  "headline": "Only two periods are dense: 2015-04-01 to 2017-07-31 and 2025-10-01 to 2026-08-31",
  "text": "The file holds 1,048,575 records but 209,001 (19.9%) fall outside these two windows, at 300-900 records/month versus ~20,000. It looks like a truncated slice of a larger table (row count equals Excel's 1,048,576 row limit). Multi-year trends are therefore not supported; deep dives use window A (and window B for a before/after contrast).",
